# Demo: time-based CVE search across changelogs
# Prerequisites: PostgreSQL running, rpm-mcp database populated

Output docs/vhs/demo_cve_timeline.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1024
Set Height 1024
Set Theme "Molokai"

Type `gemini -y -p "show me a summary of the packages updated since last month that have CVE fixes related to privilege escalation" 2>/dev/null`
Enter
Sleep 2m
